WEBVTT

00:34.388 --> 00:35.904
In the World Beyond,

00:36.249 --> 00:38.560
humans take Potions

00:39.072 --> 00:41.713
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:41.713 --> 00:44.736
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.035 --> 00:48.534
All 22 Pathways

00:48.534 --> 00:50.560
begin from Sequence 9,

00:51.456 --> 00:53.248
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:53.876 --> 00:56.033
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:57.300 --> 00:58.816
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:59.539 --> 01:02.824
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:03.828 --> 01:06.336
And such Pathways

01:07.251 --> 01:09.824
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:14.516 --> 01:17.408
(Blackthorn Security Company)

01:19.720 --> 01:20.640
(Nightmare.)

01:24.468 --> 01:26.144
(Riggins, Secret Order)

01:38.400 --> 01:40.240
Antigonus Family's Notebook.

01:50.480 --> 01:51.392
Secret Order?

01:51.800 --> 01:53.376
Antigonus Family's Notebook

01:53.376 --> 01:55.059
entered the market from his hands.

01:55.680 --> 01:57.160
No wonder he's been following Klein.

01:58.160 --> 02:00.480
Seems the Secret Order
is also searching for the notebook.

02:01.040 --> 02:02.520
They certainly won't give up easily.

02:03.120 --> 02:04.120
They'll send more people.

02:05.640 --> 02:08.280
We must find the notebook
before the Secret Order does.

02:09.200 --> 02:11.680
Captain, Klein has a clue
about the notebook.

02:12.083 --> 02:14.432
=Episode 3=
(Note: Dangerous Performance)

02:35.640 --> 02:36.480
Thank you.

02:38.240 --> 02:39.104
It'll be fine soon.

02:41.560 --> 02:42.600
I was here,

02:43.200 --> 02:44.128
with the notebook.

02:44.760 --> 02:46.320
No wonder Bacchus lost control.

02:47.200 --> 02:48.360
He was close to the notebook.

02:49.360 --> 02:51.360
A Beyonder kidnapping a child

02:51.800 --> 02:53.680
can be described as a gambler's madness.

02:54.240 --> 02:56.080
But it happened right across.

02:56.720 --> 02:57.840
Isn't it too coincidental?

03:00.880 --> 03:03.240
Captain, no notebook has been found.

03:04.040 --> 03:05.480
The deceased's son, Ray Bieber,

03:05.600 --> 03:06.640
is also missing.

03:08.040 --> 03:09.520
He is the target we are looking for.

03:10.280 --> 03:11.840
Klein, we're counting on you.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.440
Bieber's location.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.440
What's going on?

03:39.160 --> 03:41.360
The divination was disturbed
by some powerful force.

03:42.240 --> 03:43.280
Let's call it a day.

03:44.280 --> 03:45.320
I'll tell Holy Cathedral.

03:45.920 --> 03:47.040
There are other methods.

03:53.492 --> 03:56.640
(Chanis Gate)

04:03.800 --> 04:04.672
Nice coat.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.888
You look sharp in it.

04:09.640 --> 04:10.600
A citrine pendulum?

04:12.200 --> 04:14.120
Citrine can enhance
spiritual communication,

04:14.120 --> 04:15.240
boosting divination effects.

04:15.840 --> 04:16.920
You might find it useful

04:17.080 --> 04:17.952
for today's mission.

04:19.080 --> 04:21.600
Holy Cathedral has approved the use
of a Grade 2 Sealed Artifact

04:22.000 --> 04:23.360
for tracking Bieber's whereabouts.

04:24.320 --> 04:26.080
(It has been escorted to Tingen.)

04:28.880 --> 04:29.800
(Sealed Artifact?)

04:30.880 --> 04:32.560
(They are some special Beyonder items.)

04:33.440 --> 04:34.560
(Some are too magical.)

04:35.200 --> 04:36.640
(Some possess destructive power.)

04:37.280 --> 04:38.280
They need strict control.

04:38.920 --> 04:40.600
They're sealed behind each Chanis Gate.

04:42.320 --> 04:43.160
And Grade 2

04:44.280 --> 04:45.152
is the danger level.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.840
Klein Moretti

05:00.520 --> 05:03.080
has a mysterious connection
to Antigonus Family's Notebook.

05:03.560 --> 05:04.680
A Sequence 9 Seer.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.464
These two

05:06.640 --> 05:08.280
(Earl Hasen, Sleepless Pathway)
are from Backlund: Earl Hansen,

05:08.920 --> 05:10.000
(Sequence 7: Nightmare, A Nighthawk from Backlund)
Sequence 7 Nightmare,

05:11.480 --> 05:12.416
(Borgia, Corpse Collector Pathway)
and Borgia,

05:12.640 --> 05:13.600
(Sequence 8: Gravedigger, A Nighthawk from Backlund)
Sequence 8 Gravedigger.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.080
There's a third one.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.760
(Daly Simone, Corpse Collector Pathway)
Daly Simone,

05:18.320 --> 05:19.440
(Sequence 7: Spirit Medium, A Nighthawk from Backlund)
Sequence 7 Spirit Medium.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.120
Ms. Daly.

05:22.800 --> 05:24.160
Nice to see you again, Klein.

05:24.720 --> 05:26.000
This operation is dangerous.

05:26.560 --> 05:29.200
I don't think bringing along a Seer

05:29.600 --> 05:31.200
with almost zero combat ability is wise.

05:36.840 --> 05:38.000
(The Holy Cathedral)

05:38.720 --> 05:40.480
(approved 2-049.)

05:44.880 --> 05:47.120
Although it concerns
Antigonus Family's Notebook,

05:47.440 --> 05:48.896
has the Holy Cathedral assessed

05:48.896 --> 05:49.984
the risk of using 2-049?

05:50.800 --> 05:52.120
The assessment result is

05:52.400 --> 05:53.600
'extremely high risk.'

05:54.360 --> 05:55.360
But if Bieber really

05:55.360 --> 05:57.831
is the Antigonus family's descendant,
as you have speculated,

05:58.040 --> 05:59.600
the only way to quickly find him

05:59.880 --> 06:02.560
is with the 2-049 made by their family.

06:03.600 --> 06:05.960
I'm only responsible
for operating and using 2-049.

06:06.120 --> 06:07.072
Captain Dunn,

06:07.640 --> 06:08.512
let's start.

06:09.840 --> 06:11.520
Everyone, follow my action.

06:12.200 --> 06:13.360
Absolutely don't stop,

06:13.720 --> 06:15.400
or else there will be a life threat.

06:23.480 --> 06:24.352
(What the heck?)

06:24.880 --> 06:26.800
(Is opening a Sealed Artifact
this strange?)

06:27.360 --> 06:28.360
(This can keep us safe?)

06:30.440 --> 06:32.480
(Why do I hear the music
from radio gymnastics?)

06:33.200 --> 06:34.680
(Could the risk of 2-049)

06:34.960 --> 06:36.600
(be killing people with embarrassment?)

06:51.760 --> 06:52.672
It's alive?

07:08.760 --> 07:10.160
Could such a cute little thing

07:10.520 --> 07:11.560
also be dangerous?

07:17.120 --> 07:18.080
(No.)

07:18.080 --> 07:19.008
(I can't move.)

07:22.080 --> 07:23.040
(Will)

07:23.040 --> 07:24.160
(I turn into)

07:24.736 --> 07:25.576
(a)

07:25.576 --> 07:26.464
(wooden)

07:26.464 --> 07:27.392
(puppet?)

07:36.400 --> 07:37.376
What happened?

07:45.960 --> 07:47.960
This little thing seems to like you.

07:48.440 --> 07:50.640
Normally, closer you are,
likelier it targets you.

07:51.200 --> 07:52.880
Maybe because
Klein touched the notebook.

07:53.520 --> 07:55.200
As long as there is a bit of aura

07:55.200 --> 07:56.355
of the Antigonus family,

07:56.440 --> 07:57.880
2-049 will have a reaction.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.600
Don't worry.

07:59.600 --> 08:01.760
Although 2-049 has the characteristics
of being alive,

08:02.280 --> 08:04.200
and it will escape by luring the guards

08:04.560 --> 08:05.800
to trigger disaster,

08:06.440 --> 08:07.872
among all its peers, it's not

08:07.872 --> 08:10.720
a murderous demon.

08:11.040 --> 08:12.096
Captain?

08:12.240 --> 08:14.120
The breach of 2-049

08:14.560 --> 08:16.840
randomly controls one to two
people within five meters,

08:17.240 --> 08:18.200
causing a puppet state.

08:18.880 --> 08:19.760
If controlled,

08:20.000 --> 08:21.360
they can be freed with a waking-up

08:21.680 --> 08:22.520
external force.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.320
(So the stretching)

08:25.480 --> 08:26.600
(is for easy observation.)

08:27.120 --> 08:28.440
If everyone is controlled...

08:29.040 --> 08:30.560
That is impossible to occur.

08:44.760 --> 08:45.696
Bieber's coat?

08:48.040 --> 08:49.040
2-049

08:49.320 --> 08:50.280
becomes berserk.

08:51.040 --> 08:52.400
It is confirmed that Ray Bieber

08:52.680 --> 08:54.960
is a descendant of the Antigonus family.

08:55.480 --> 08:57.200
Commence tracking immediately.

09:09.600 --> 09:12.720
Living for over 20 years, I've never
had such social annihilation before.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.160
Alright, you can stop now.

09:21.680 --> 09:22.592
Get in the carriage.

09:34.452 --> 09:37.408
(Lord of Mysteries)

09:39.508 --> 09:44.511
(Secret Order)

09:46.707 --> 09:48.680
(Dock Warehouse)

09:48.680 --> 09:50.440
In the name of the family,

09:50.600 --> 09:52.520
may the bloodline revive

09:52.880 --> 09:54.480
and the glory return.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.800
(Ray Bieber)
Antigonus.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.360
(I'm late.)

10:24.280 --> 10:26.080
(The notebook
has already been absorbed.)

10:33.200 --> 10:34.160
Perhaps there is still

10:34.160 --> 10:35.520
a divine turning point.

10:36.920 --> 10:37.800
Little grub,

10:38.440 --> 10:39.720
your gift has arrived.

10:40.160 --> 10:41.960
Let me perform a magic trick for you

10:42.680 --> 10:43.880
and help you.

10:50.160 --> 10:51.264
We've arrived.

10:56.760 --> 10:57.880
Bieber is right here.

10:58.560 --> 11:00.600
(Is this little puppet showing loyalty,)

11:00.880 --> 11:02.320
(or is it sabotaging?)

11:03.560 --> 11:04.448
Klein.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.880
There is danger in the warehouse.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.640
There is danger in the warehouse.

11:14.520 --> 11:15.360
There is danger.

11:19.920 --> 11:20.832
Very great.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.064
Level One alert.

12:21.600 --> 12:22.560
He's out of control.

12:23.648 --> 12:24.864
(Slumber Talisman)
Stay away.

12:24.864 --> 12:25.720
Protect yourself.

12:29.400 --> 12:31.080
The threat of fear.

12:31.760 --> 12:33.040
Crimson hope.

12:33.520 --> 12:35.920
At least one thing is true.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.160
That is, this life flees.

12:39.840 --> 12:41.680
One thing is true.

12:42.000 --> 12:43.760
The rest is all lies.

12:45.600 --> 12:47.360
After the flower blooms,

12:47.920 --> 12:49.920
it forever dies.

13:16.520 --> 13:17.600
This is bad.

13:17.600 --> 13:18.760
Midnight Chant didn't work.

13:25.320 --> 13:26.840
(It's not usual Beyonder derailment.)

13:27.880 --> 13:28.720
(It is a spirit.)

13:35.880 --> 13:37.840
Daly, find its weakness.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.600
Death's

13:45.120 --> 13:46.000
Gaze.

13:53.760 --> 13:55.240
It seems it's just a spirit.

13:56.040 --> 13:57.160
The notebook controls it.

13:57.760 --> 13:58.960
Our attacks are very limited.

13:59.280 --> 14:00.160
Found it.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.240
I need you to control it

14:03.240 --> 14:04.320
for at least three seconds.

14:06.000 --> 14:07.008
Hold it.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.880
Dream Net.

14:13.760 --> 14:15.880
She blooms all night until dawn.

14:17.320 --> 14:20.480
But when the day opens its eyes...

14:26.960 --> 14:27.936
Stared,

14:28.080 --> 14:29.120
she is so ashamed.

14:29.520 --> 14:31.400
With nowhere to hide,

14:32.320 --> 14:34.800
she withers and wilts in the dizziness.

14:37.880 --> 14:38.752
We held it.

14:43.760 --> 14:44.672
The notebook?

15:09.400 --> 15:10.432
Keep an eye on it.

15:11.760 --> 15:12.704
Sandman.

15:26.560 --> 15:27.584
Earl!

15:37.960 --> 15:38.880
Stared,

15:39.400 --> 15:40.400
she is so ashamed.

15:41.240 --> 15:43.840
With nowhere to hide...

15:47.200 --> 15:48.640
(You do shout with great effort.)

15:49.240 --> 15:51.040
(But compared
to the gray mist's mumbling,)

15:51.920 --> 15:52.840
(it's far off.)

15:54.800 --> 15:55.744
Nocturnal

15:56.480 --> 15:57.408
Slumber.

16:19.400 --> 16:20.560
Nether Hand.

16:33.520 --> 16:34.432
Daly!

16:40.600 --> 16:41.504
Daly?

16:49.043 --> 16:51.712
(Goddess's Gaze Healing Potion)

16:54.160 --> 16:55.680
Hornacis.

16:56.040 --> 16:57.280
Flegrea.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.120
Hornacis.

16:59.360 --> 17:00.320
Flegrea.

17:00.320 --> 17:01.360
Hornacis.

17:01.800 --> 17:03.000
Flegrea.

17:03.240 --> 17:07.040
Hornacis.

17:13.640 --> 17:15.520
Antigonus Family's Notebook?

17:28.400 --> 17:29.248
A phantom?

17:32.800 --> 17:33.640
Keep the notebook.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.680
Do not approach 2-049.

17:36.280 --> 17:38.840
When the sun sets in the west,

17:39.280 --> 17:41.920
dew adorns the collar of dusk.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.160
The circus clown?

17:50.240 --> 17:51.232
Another phantom?

17:52.120 --> 17:53.360
At least a Sequence 7 Beyonder.

18:01.680 --> 18:02.560
Stay away from 2-049.

18:02.880 --> 18:03.776
And guard it.

18:34.560 --> 18:35.920
He dodged every strike in advance.

18:36.480 --> 18:37.480
Such tactical foresight?

18:38.600 --> 18:40.200
He can foresee actions' paths?

18:41.080 --> 18:43.120
If given some lead time
before the attack...

18:49.040 --> 18:49.920
It worked?

18:52.640 --> 18:53.600
(Alright.)

18:53.720 --> 18:55.040
(That's random shooting.)

18:56.600 --> 18:58.320
The threat of fear.

18:58.600 --> 19:00.000
Crimson hope.

19:00.760 --> 19:02.360
At least one thing is true.

19:02.360 --> 19:03.400
Damage Transfer.

19:14.320 --> 19:15.264
Klein!

19:24.240 --> 19:25.120
A paper substitute?

19:40.840 --> 19:41.824
(No.)

20:08.880 --> 20:09.856
(Stay calm.)

20:10.440 --> 20:11.296
(I must)

20:11.296 --> 20:12.320
(save myself.)

20:13.440 --> 20:14.520
(An external force...)

20:14.520 --> 20:15.680
(A waking-up external force.)

20:17.360 --> 20:18.336
(The gray mist?)

20:20.960 --> 20:21.920
(Immortal Worthy)

20:22.680 --> 20:24.280
(of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.)

20:25.320 --> 20:26.272
(Majestic Worthy)

20:26.840 --> 20:28.520
(of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.)

20:29.680 --> 20:30.592
(Venerable Worthy)

20:31.280 --> 20:32.200
(of Heaven and Earth)

20:32.800 --> 20:33.696
(for)

20:33.800 --> 20:34.720
(Blessings.)

20:34.880 --> 20:35.840
(Celestial Worthy)

20:36.480 --> 20:37.408
(of Heaven)

20:37.560 --> 20:38.432
(and Earth)

20:38.592 --> 20:39.520
(for)

20:39.960 --> 20:41.056
(Blessings.)

20:50.600 --> 20:51.552
(Luckily, it worked.)

20:52.520 --> 20:54.520
(I thought 2-049
could control up to two at most.)

20:55.240 --> 20:56.440
(Was it due to the notebook?)

20:57.440 --> 20:59.000
(So that clown was feigning attacks?)

20:59.480 --> 21:00.560
(His true purpose was)

21:01.360 --> 21:02.880
(to have all of us controlled.)

21:03.960 --> 21:05.000
(The longer I stay,)

21:05.408 --> 21:06.784
(the more danger they're in.)

21:07.680 --> 21:08.640
(But if I go back,)

21:09.200 --> 21:10.240
(what if...)

21:10.880 --> 21:12.280
(Right, divination.)

21:16.800 --> 21:18.800
Returning to the real world
is very safe.

21:27.600 --> 21:28.544
(Safe.)

21:37.040 --> 21:37.880
(I can move now.)

21:39.000 --> 21:40.360
Do you want to be awakened?

21:41.480 --> 21:43.240
Do you want to save your colleagues?

21:47.280 --> 21:50.160
Actually, I've quite liked you
since I first met you.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.880
Let's make a deal.

21:53.160 --> 21:54.720
I'll lift the control for you.

21:54.800 --> 21:55.720
And you give me

21:56.320 --> 21:57.440
that notebook.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.280
Real illusion?

22:01.240 --> 22:02.720
Which Sequence's ability is this?

22:03.680 --> 22:04.520
Of course,

22:04.840 --> 22:06.240
to show my sincerity,

22:06.840 --> 22:09.520
I'm willing to add new stakes
to this deal.

22:11.160 --> 22:13.280
As a former Seer,

22:14.160 --> 22:15.680
I will grant you an answer.

22:16.240 --> 22:17.280
For example,

22:17.520 --> 22:20.080
the Seer Pathway's Sequence 8.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.176
(Is it true)

22:22.360 --> 22:23.232
(or false?)

22:23.800 --> 22:24.920
(As a former Seer,)

22:25.200 --> 22:27.120
(how could he misjudge
my current state?)

22:27.720 --> 22:29.680
(Did the gray mist
affect the divination results?)

22:30.800 --> 22:32.000
Don't worry.

22:32.720 --> 22:35.200
The puppet has already
rendered everyone else unconscious.

22:35.520 --> 22:37.400
Our little secret

22:37.400 --> 22:39.160
will stay between us.

22:42.040 --> 22:42.920
Alright,

22:43.120 --> 22:44.000
make your decision.

22:44.520 --> 22:46.720
Believe me,
you don't have much time left.

22:51.880 --> 22:52.960
Listen carefully,

22:53.880 --> 22:56.360
the Seer Pathway's Sequence 8 is...

23:28.840 --> 23:29.856
(What?)

23:32.560 --> 23:34.280
(The puppet control)

23:35.760 --> 23:37.760
(is still in effect.)

23:41.240 --> 23:42.960
(How could he)

23:43.640 --> 23:44.640
(not be...)

23:49.200 --> 23:50.240
(Damage)

23:51.160 --> 23:52.128
(Trans...)

24:03.440 --> 24:04.640
(It's indeed Secret Order.)

24:11.000 --> 24:13.080
Hornacis.

24:14.520 --> 24:16.520
Hornacis.

24:17.760 --> 24:20.880
Hornacis.

24:30.680 --> 24:32.400
It's Hornacis again.

24:49.840 --> 24:51.040
I wanted to save you.

24:52.040 --> 24:53.152
But I found

24:53.440 --> 24:54.304
you were even able

24:54.304 --> 24:56.639
to drive the clown
into 2-049's control zone.

24:58.360 --> 24:59.488
Don't mind.

24:59.720 --> 25:01.520
There are always some special people

25:01.960 --> 25:03.520
who can do what others cannot.

25:04.240 --> 25:05.184
For example, you.

25:05.640 --> 25:06.640
And for example,

25:07.360 --> 25:08.288
me.

25:13.120 --> 25:14.240
(What a narcissist!)

25:41.160 --> 25:43.160
I know you're curious
about this notebook.

25:44.080 --> 25:45.760
But the Holy Cathedral must confirm it

25:46.160 --> 25:47.136
before you can read it.

25:48.680 --> 25:49.600
Captain,

25:49.760 --> 25:50.840
you just said that already.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.280
Did I?

25:55.800 --> 25:56.840
The incident is resolved.

25:57.600 --> 25:58.640
You performed very well.

25:59.760 --> 26:01.560
You prevented
a Beyonder derailment disaster

26:02.600 --> 26:04.200
and thwarted the Secret Order's plot.

26:05.800 --> 26:07.320
I'll tell the Holy Cathedral about it.

26:08.040 --> 26:09.040
You'll soon be official.

26:17.760 --> 26:18.816
Captain,

26:18.816 --> 26:20.280
I don't understand something.

26:21.320 --> 26:22.760
Why didn't Bieber leave Tingen

26:23.560 --> 26:25.400
before facing such danger?

26:27.600 --> 26:29.320
People influenced by ancient evil forces

26:29.920 --> 26:31.480
often make wrong decisions.

26:53.800 --> 26:54.656
Don't think too much.

26:55.520 --> 26:56.416
By killing him,

26:56.760 --> 26:58.240
you have saved even more people.

26:59.440 --> 27:00.280
Don't mind too much.

27:05.120 --> 27:06.112
Captain,

27:06.720 --> 27:07.640
there's one more thing.

27:08.704 --> 27:09.720
I already know

27:09.720 --> 27:11.440
what Sequence 8 of the Seer Pathway is.

27:14.920 --> 27:15.840
It's Clown.

27:27.080 --> 27:28.160
When Daly has recovered,

27:28.840 --> 27:30.120
I'll send her back to Backlund.

27:30.784 --> 27:31.712
Okay.

27:32.880 --> 27:33.888
Klein, right?

27:34.800 --> 27:36.840
Your performance today
is truly impressive.

27:37.200 --> 27:38.040
Only a Sequence 9,

27:38.440 --> 27:39.296
yet you killed

27:39.296 --> 27:41.279
a Secret Order member of Sequence 7.

27:41.960 --> 27:43.080
How did you do that?

27:44.000 --> 27:45.440
(The inevitable arrives.)

27:46.360 --> 27:47.400
I can barely believe it.

27:47.960 --> 27:48.960
It's the goddess's favor.

27:49.720 --> 27:50.960
The clown calculated everything

27:51.200 --> 27:53.200
but didn't foresee
that 2-049 didn't control me.

27:53.840 --> 27:54.840
It may be

27:54.840 --> 27:56.000
due to the notebook I bring.

27:56.400 --> 27:57.408
Therefore,

27:57.560 --> 27:58.840
he used waking you as leverage,

27:59.640 --> 28:00.480
but you used it

28:00.840 --> 28:01.960
to control him instead

28:02.960 --> 28:04.032
and then killed him

28:04.560 --> 28:05.440
with one shot.

28:08.960 --> 28:09.888
Maybe more than one.

28:10.560 --> 28:12.320
I often feel ashamed
of my shooting skills.

28:12.880 --> 28:13.960
But the goddess favored me.

28:15.160 --> 28:16.000
I must say,

28:16.680 --> 28:19.240
you are the most outstanding Seer
I have ever seen.

28:19.960 --> 28:21.640
Young man, you have a promising future.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.120
Thank you.

28:28.720 --> 28:29.632
Klein.

28:31.040 --> 28:32.520
What are you pondering?

28:35.360 --> 28:36.640
Maybe I'm just a bit tired.

28:36.840 --> 28:38.000
You did have a long day.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.720
Rest this afternoon.

28:46.720 --> 28:47.720
(Just now,)

28:47.720 --> 28:49.080
(the potion loosened.)

28:50.640 --> 28:51.720
(There must be something)

28:51.960 --> 28:53.320
(that boosted my digestion of it.)

28:55.240 --> 28:57.240
(Is the next potion 'Clown'?)

28:59.240 --> 29:00.960
(It's time to consider the advancement.)

29:01.920 --> 29:03.960
(As for the murmurs about Hornacis,)

29:04.600 --> 29:06.840
(maybe someone who studies history
knows more about it.)

29:08.080 --> 29:09.120
(I need to go back)

29:09.800 --> 29:11.280
(and visit Klein's teacher.)

29:19.732 --> 29:23.200
(Hoy University)

29:24.080 --> 29:25.040
Hornacis?

29:26.720 --> 29:28.360
Yes, Mr. Azik.

29:28.360 --> 29:33.536
(Azik Eggers, Teacher
of History at Hoy University)

29:37.200 --> 29:38.360
Before the incident,

29:38.360 --> 29:39.328
we studied

29:39.328 --> 29:41.146
an ancient Antigonus Family's Notebook.

29:42.160 --> 29:44.600
Herein lied the Nation of the Evernight
in the Hornacis Range.

29:47.160 --> 29:48.760
The Antigonus family?

29:49.400 --> 29:50.360
Nation of the Evernight?

29:51.720 --> 29:52.640
They sound familiar.

29:52.960 --> 29:54.160
I think I've heard of them.

29:55.680 --> 29:58.440
Well, maybe it's just
the similarity of word roots.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.136
Mr. Azik,

30:03.480 --> 30:04.680
if you remember anything

30:05.000 --> 30:06.240
or obtain any more information,

30:06.680 --> 30:07.560
could you write to me?

30:09.240 --> 30:10.112
No problem.

30:10.440 --> 30:11.600
Then I won't disturb you.

30:12.320 --> 30:13.480
I need to resolve some

30:13.640 --> 30:14.528
work-related matters.

30:20.880 --> 30:22.040
Thanks again for the gift.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.520
I should thank you

30:24.640 --> 30:25.760
for your guidance.

30:28.080 --> 30:28.960
Klein.

30:30.400 --> 30:31.424
You are now working

30:31.424 --> 30:33.571
for a security company
that searches for antiquities?

30:34.400 --> 30:35.392
Yes.

30:35.880 --> 30:36.736
As you know,

30:36.880 --> 30:37.840
I enjoy history.

30:39.240 --> 30:41.000
It is a good thing.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.960
But it's also easy to encounter

30:45.160 --> 30:46.960
some forbidden areas hidden in the dark.

30:48.320 --> 30:49.200
Once you step in,

30:49.720 --> 30:50.880
it will bring misfortune.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.152
In short,

30:54.760 --> 30:55.680
always be careful.

30:57.320 --> 30:58.208
I got it,

30:58.680 --> 30:59.648
Mr. Azik.

31:09.040 --> 31:10.480
Antigonus

31:12.120 --> 31:13.560
and Nation of the Evernight?

32:23.956 --> 32:29.137
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

32:29.930 --> 32:37.696
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

32:37.975 --> 32:41.344
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

32:41.558 --> 32:44.768
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

32:44.982 --> 32:50.560
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

32:50.560 --> 32:53.760
♪Wonder or dismay♪

32:53.760 --> 32:57.386
♪Madness or decay♪

32:57.910 --> 32:59.966
♪With fragile light♪

32:59.966 --> 33:04.032
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

33:04.032 --> 33:07.695
♪Stirring or delay♪

33:07.695 --> 33:11.008
♪Rebirth or be same♪

33:11.575 --> 33:16.842
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

33:17.111 --> 33:20.672
♪Fade away♪
